  m_text: '<b><color=#BF3500>Add-Ons</color></b> are hair pieces that can be freely
    moved around the head of your character by <b><color=#BF3500>Left Clicking</color></b>
    on the piece and dragging with your mouse


    While editing Add-Ons, use <b><color=#BF3500>right
    click</color></b> to rotate the camera around your character.


